            "line": 307,
            "text": "theorem exists_admissibleScales {f : ℕ → Inner → V}\n    (hf : ∀ j, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (f j)) {h : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h)\n    {K : Set Inner} (hK : IsCompact K) (B : ℕ) :\n    ∃ a : ℕ → ℕ, B ≤ a 0 ∧ AdmissibleScales h f K a"
